# Pi's "chrome" MCP server (agent-chrome-mcp): the Playwright Extension's token, so it connects without the approval page.
# 値は書かない。参照だけ。1Password の Agents vault に API Credential «playwright-extension» を作り、credential に
# 拡張機能のアイコン → Manage clients に出る PLAYWRIGHT_MCP_EXTENSION_TOKEN の値を入れる。
PLAYWRIGHT_MCP_EXTENSION_TOKEN=op://Agents/playwright-extension/credential
